         <div type="performance_playbill" rend="align(center)">
            <ab><placeName ref="namedentities.xml#covent_garden"><hi rend="allcaps">New Theatre Royal, Covent-Garden</hi></placeName><lb/>
               This present <hi rend="allcaps">Friday</hi>, <date when="1811-02-01">Feb. 1, 1811</date>, will be acted (5th time) the revived Comedy of<lb/>
               <bibl><title type="main" ref="namedentities.xml#play_twelfth_night">The <hi rend="allcaps">Twelfth Night</hi>;</title><lb/>
                  <title type="sub"><hi rend="italic">Or, <hi rend="allcaps">What You Will</hi>.</hi></title></bibl><lb/>
               <castList>
                  <castItem><role>Duke Orsino,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_barrymore">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Barrymore</hi>,</actor></castItem> <castItem><role>Valentine,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_claremont">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Claremont</hi>,</actor></castItem> <castItem><role>Curio,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_field">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Field</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Paolo,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_bishop">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Bishop</hi>,</actor></castItem> <castItem><role>Cosino,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_bond">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Bond</hi>,</actor></castItem> <castItem><role>Sir Toby Belch,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#jo_em">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Emery</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Sir Andrew Ague-Cheek,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#wi_bl">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Blanchard</hi>,</actor></castItem> <castItem><role>Sebastian,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_brunton">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Brunton</hi>,</actor></castItem> <castItem><role>Antonio,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_hamerton">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Hamerton</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Roberto,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_jefferies">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Jefferies</hi>,</actor></castItem> <castItem><role>Friar,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#wi_at">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Atkins</hi>,</actor></castItem> <castItem><role>Officer,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_king">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">King</hi>,</actor></castItem> <castItem><role>Malvolio,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#jo_li">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Liston</hi></actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Clown,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#jo_fa">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Fawcett</hi>,</actor></castItem> <castItem><role>Fabian,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#ch_fa">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Farley</hi>,</actor></castItem> <castItem><role>Pietro,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_sarjant">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Sarjant</hi>,</actor></castItem> <castItem><role>Luigi,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_heath">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Heath</hi>,</actor></castItem> <castItem><role>Sailor,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_powers">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Powers</hi>,</actor></castItem>
                  <castItem><role>Olivia,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#ma_th_ke">Mrs. <hi rend="allcaps">C. Kemble</hi>,</actor></castItem> <castItem><role>Viola,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#sa_bo">Miss <hi rend="allcaps">S. Booth</hi>,</actor></castItem> <castItem><role>Maria,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#ma_gi">Mrs. <hi rend="allcaps">Gibbs</hi></actor></castItem><lb/>
               </castList>
               After which will be performed (<hi rend="italic">for the 32d time</hi>) a New Pantomime, called
               <bibl><title type="main" ref="namedentities.xml#play_harlequin_and_asmodeus">Harlequin &amp; Asmodeus</title><lb/>
                  <title type="sub"><hi rend="allcaps">Or,</hi><lb/>
                     <hi rend="italic"><hi rend="allcaps">Cupid</hi> on <hi rend="allcaps">Crutches</hi>.</hi></title></bibl><lb/>
               <hi rend="italic">With entirely new Musick, Machinery, Scenes, Dresses and Decorations</hi>.<lb/>
               The Overture and Musick composed by <persName ref="namedentities.xml#mr_ware">Mr. <hi rend="italic">Ware</hi></persName>.<lb/>
               <hi rend="italic">The Scenes painted by Mess. <persName ref="namedentities.xml#sa_wh">Whitmore</persName>, <persName ref="namedentities.xml#jo_he_gr">Grieve</persName>, <persName ref="namedentities.xml#j_ho">Hollogan</persName>, <persName ref="namedentities.xml#mr_ho">Hodgins</persName>, &amp; their assistants.</hi><lb/>
               The <hi rend="smallcaps">Machinery</hi> and <hi rend="smallcaps">Tricks</hi> by <hi rend="italic">Mess. <persName ref="namedentities.xml#mr_saul">Saul</persName>, <persName ref="namedentities.xml#mr_bradwell">Bradwell</persName>, <persName ref="namedentities.xml#jo_cr">Creswell</persName>, <persName ref="namedentities.xml#pi_bo">sen. Bologna,</persName> jun. &amp;c. &amp;c.</hi><lb/>
               The Dresses by <persName ref="namedentities.xml#mr_flowers">Mr. Flowers</persName> and <persName ref="namedentities.xml#miss_egan">Miss Egan</persName>.<lb/>
               The pantomime produced under the Direction of <persName ref="namedentities.xml#ch_fa">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Farley</hi></persName>-The Dancers by <persName ref="namedentities.xml#jo_pe_bo">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Bologna</hi>, Jun.</persName><lb/>
               <castList>
                  <castItem><role>Don Cleofas Zambullo (afterwards Harlequin),</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#jo_pe_bo">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Bologna, Jun.</hi></actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Don Pedro Alvaro (afterwards Pantaloon),</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#jo_no">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Norman</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>The Old Duenna (afterwards Clown),</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#jo_gr">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Grimaldi</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Pillardoc (afterwards Lover),</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_king">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">King</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Asmodeus (afterwards Cupid),</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_chapman">Master <hi rend="allcaps">Chapman</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Plutus,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_tinney">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Tinney</hi>,</actor></castItem> <castItem><role>The Daemon of Interest,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_treby">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Treby</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Bonifacie (the Innkeeper),</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#jo_pe_bo">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Bologna</hi>,</actor></castItem> <castItem><role>Pasquerelio,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_morell">Master <hi rend="allcaps">Morell</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role><hi rend="italic">Smugglers</hi></role>, Mess. <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_droset">Droset,</actor> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_hickman">Hickman,</actor> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_norris">Norris</actor>,</castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role><hi rend="italic">Bull Fighters</hi></role>, Mess. <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_brown">Brown,</actor> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_gaywood">Gaywood,</actor> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_grant">Grant,</actor> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_heath">Heath,</actor> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_louis">Louis,</actor> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_pl">Platt,</actor> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_powers">Powers,</actor> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_sarjant">Sarjant</actor>,</castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role><hi rend="italic">Spainards, Seranaders, &amp;c. &amp;c. by</hi></role> Mess. <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_i_bellamy">I. Bellamy,</actor> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_bishop">Bishop,</actor> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_bond">Bond,</actor> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_lee">Lee,</actor> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#ja_st">Street,</actor> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_williams">Williams,</actor> <role>Donna Seraphina (afterwards Colombine,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#so_pa">Mrs. <hi rend="allcaps">Parker</hi></actor>,</castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role><hi rend="italic">Smuggler's Wives</hi></role>, <actor ref="namedentities.xml#el_co">Mrs. Coates</actor> and <actor ref="namedentities.xml#h_wh">Mrs. Whitmore</actor>,</castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role><hi rend="italic">Spanish Dancers</hi></role>, Mesdames <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mrs_bologna">Bologna,</actor> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mrs_i_bologna">I. Bologna,</actor> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mrs_cox">Cox,</actor> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mrs_heath">Heath,</actor> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mrs_louis">Louis,</actor> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mrs_ryall">Ryall,</actor> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mrs_standen">Standen,</actor> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mrs_watt">Watt</actor>,</castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role><hi rend="italic">Spanish Ladies</hi></role>, Mesdames <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mrs_findlay">Findlay,</actor>, <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mrs_grimaldi">Grimaldi,</actor> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mrs_hardy">Hardy,</actor> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mrs_iliff">Iliff,</actor> <actor>Price.</actor></castItem><lb/>
               </castList>
               <hi rend="italic">Books of the Pantomime to be had in the Theatre, price <measure type="currency">10d.</measure></hi><lb/>
               <hi rend="italic">Places for the Boxes to be taken of <persName ref="namedentities.xml#jo_wi_br">Mr. Brandon</persName> at the new Box-Office, <lb/>
               Prince's-place, Hart-street, from Ten till Four.<lb/></hi>
               Boxes <measure type="currency">7s</measure>. Second Price <measure type="currency">3s 6d</measure>-Pit <measure type="currency">3s 6d</measure>. Second Price <measure type="currency">2s</measure>.<lb/>
               Lower Gallery <measure type="currency">2s</measure>. Second Price <measure type="currency">1s</measure>.-Upper Gallery <measure type="currency">1s</measure>. Second Price <measure type="currency">6d</measure>.<lb/>
               The Doors will be opened at <time when="17:30:00"><hi rend="allcaps">Half</hi> past <hi rend="allcaps">Five</hi></time>, and the Play begin at <time when="18:30:00"><hi rend="allcaps">Half</hi> past <hi rend="allcaps">Six</hi></time>.<lb/>
               <hi rend="allcaps">Vivant Rex &amp; Regina</hi><lb/>
               The new Pantomime of <hi rend="allcaps">Harlequin &amp; Asmodeus</hi>; or <hi rend="allcaps">Cupid</hi> on <hi rend="allcaps">Crutches</hi><lb/>
               being received with the loudest bursts of applause, will be repeated every night till further notice.</ab>
         </div>
